@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@access = REEMPLAZA_POR_EL_ACCESS_DE_LOGIN
@refresh = REEMPLAZA_POR_EL_REFRESH_MAS_RECIENTE

### Salud de API y base de datos
GET {{base}}/api/health/

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"TU_CONTRASENA"}

### Mi perfil
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Lista de roles (ADMIN)
GET {{base}}/api/roles/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Crear usuario (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/usuarios/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"username":"empleado01","email":"empleado01@example.com","first_name":"Ana","last_name":"Lopez","telefono":"3312345678","password":"ClaveEmpleado!2026","rol_codigo":"VENTAS"}

### Lista de usuarios (ADMIN)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Refrescar JWT: usa el NUEVO refresh que se devuelve
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh":"{{refresh}}"}

### Cerrar sesión: invalida el refresh más reciente
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"refresh":"{{refresh}}"}
